  "body": "Immerse yourself in one of Manly's most sought-after coastal pockets with this substantial family home, perfectly situated on a generous 1521 square metre freehold section just steps from Little Manly Beach. Enjoy breathtaking sea views of Rangitoto and beyond, all from a private position that emphasises tranquillity and serenity.\r\n\r\nDesigned for both relaxation and entertainment, this immaculate brick and cedar home is positioned to maximise privacy, nestled beside a local reserve that offers beautiful vistas from the kitchen and living areas. You'll love the all-day sun that floods the interior, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated to a high standard-complete with a new roof, this property boasts a standout feature: its expansive north and west-facing section, rich with potential. Imagine the possibilities for a private minor dwelling or enhancements that cater to your family's needs.\r\n\r\nWith a flexible split-level layout featuring 3 to 4 bedrooms, 1 to 2 lounges, 3 bathrooms, and 4 WC, this residence is the perfect haven for large families. The option of two master suites-each with an en-suite-on both the ground and upper floors allows you to tailor the space. Consider using the upper master as a welcoming guest suite or a spacious second lounge, adapting the home to your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStep outside to discover seamless indoor/outdoor connectivity. Unwind on the covered deck, where you can watch the kids play or host vibrant summer gatherings under the sun. \r\n\r\nThe internal access double garage, complete with a workshop area and a small office, provides ample space for vehicles, hobbies, and work-from-home essentials. Location is key, and this home truly delivers! Just minutes from the lively Manly Village and Whangaparaoa Plaza, with Whangaparaoa School within easy walking distance-everything you need is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFor astute buyers, registered Valuation and LIM are available, ensuring you have all the information you need to make a wise investment. Don't miss this rare opportunity to secure your spacious coastal sanctuary in an unbeatable setting-bring the entire family and make this dream home yours today!\r\n\r\nCall now for your private viewing-opportunities like this won't last long!",
